# Canonical author identity for `git log`, `git shortlog -sne`, and GitHub's
# contributor graph.
#
# The first PwrGit commits (2026-07-13 through 2026-07-29) were authored from
# a machine still configured with an old employer address, and a handful more
# used a bare username instead of a full name. The commits themselves are not
# rewritten — that would re-point the v0.4.0 through v0.8.0 tags — so this
# file maps both back onto the identity the rest of the history uses.
Harold Hunt <harold@pwrdrvr.com>
